{"surah":101,"ayahs":[{"numberInSurah":1,"arabicText":"اَلْقَارِعَةُۙ","translation":"The Calamity!"},{"numberInSurah":2,"arabicText":"مَا الْقَارِعَةُۚ","translation":"What is the Calamity?"},{"numberInSurah":3,"arabicText":"وَ مَاۤ اَدْرٰىكَ مَا الْقَارِعَةُؕ","translation":"And what do you know what the Calamity is?"},{"numberInSurah":4,"arabicText":"یَوْمَ یَكُوْنُ النَّاسُ كَالْفَرَاشِ الْمَبْثُوْثِۙ","translation":"On that Day human beings shall be like scattered moths,"},{"numberInSurah":5,"arabicText":"وَ تَكُوْنُ الْجِبَالُ كَالْعِهْنِ الْمَنْفُوْشِؕ","translation":"and the mountains shall be like fluffs of carded wool in varying colours."},{"numberInSurah":6,"arabicText":"فَاَمَّا مَنْ ثَقُلَتْ مَوَازِیْنُهٗۙ","translation":"Then he whose scales weigh heavier"},{"numberInSurah":7,"arabicText":"فَهُوَ فِیْ عِیْشَةٍ رَّاضِیَةٍؕ","translation":"shall have a blissful life;"},{"numberInSurah":8,"arabicText":"وَ اَمَّا مَنْ خَفَّتْ مَوَازِیْنُهٗۙ","translation":"but he whose scales weigh lighter,"},{"numberInSurah":9,"arabicText":"فَاُمُّهٗ هَاوِیَةٌؕ","translation":"his shall be the deep pit for a dwelling."},{"numberInSurah":10,"arabicText":"وَ مَاۤ اَدْرٰىكَ مَاهِیَهْؕ","translation":"And what do you know what that is?"},{"numberInSurah":11,"arabicText":"نَارٌ حَامِیَةٌ۠ ۧ","translation":"A Blazing Fire!"}]}